{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>See</b> — [it has a] vav, [in] 'and your heart shall live.' [It is] like a soft kaf in the Ishmaelite tongue, as in: 'On the third day Abraham lifted up his eyes' (Genesis 22:4), 'and he left his young men' (Genesis 22:5) — 'and you who seek Elohim, see this and your heart shall live.'"], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 69, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:33:36.525138563Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}